# Force LF everywhere so byte-for-byte golden/parity comparisons hold on every
# platform — Windows CI would otherwise check out CRLF (core.autocrlf) and the
# fixtures + committed goldens would diverge from the LF originals.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touched by line-ending normalization.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# The embedded model weights: binary blobs that must never be line-ending
# normalised. `* text=auto` would rely on git's heuristic; this states it.
crates/argot-rules-semantic/model/embeddings.safetensors binary
crates/argot-rules-semantic/model/tokenizer.json -text
